Subject: [PATCH 6.1.y 3/8] ipv6: pass proto by value to ipv6_push_nfrag_opts() and ipv6_push_frag_opts()
Date: Tue,  1 Sep 2026 15:28:28 -0400
Message-ID: <20260901192833.1439569-3-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0
In-Reply-To: <20260901192833.1439569-1-sashal@kernel.org>
